OL,3,GNEWSAAsylum seeker jailed after
OL,4,Aexposing himself to girls in their
OL,5,Abedroom
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn asylum seeker who arrived in the UK
OL,8,Fin March has been jailed after breaking
OL,9,Finto a family home and exposing himself
OL,10,Fto two children.
OL,12,FMohammed Abbas, 29, entered the home in
OL,13,FCardiff on 30 July 2025 and went into
OL,14,Fthe bedroom where the two children and
OL,15,Ftheir older sister were sleeping.
OL,17,FHe previously pleaded guilty to
OL,18,Fburglary, trespass on a premises with
OL,19,Fintent to commit a sexual offence, and
OL,20,Ftwo counts of engaging in sexual
OL,21,Factivity in the presence of a child. He
OL,22,Fwas sentenced to six years in prison.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
