OL,3,GNEWSAAsylum seeker jailed after
OL,4,Aexposing himself to girls in their
OL,5,Abedroom
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe victims' mother said: "It has
OL,8,Faffected my daughters' emotional
OL,9,Fwellbeing, their education and the
OL,10,Fability to feel safe in their home.
OL,11,FEvery child deserves to feel safe in
OL,12,Ftheir own home."
